g and the execute-stage ALU, taking 199.837 ns through 156 cells.\\nalu.sv expresses signed and unsigned division and remainder with separate\\nnative / and % operators. These deeply combinational arithmetic networks\\nare the strongest suspected source of the long path. The experiment log\\ncontains only the baseline, with no previous divider micro-optimizations.\\nShortening th\n…[94504 of 97576 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:22420a8cfb0eac84]…\ns\": 117.75, \"delta_pct\": 13.9, \"vs_baseline\": 871.53, \"fmax_mhz\": 49.426, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4197517, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3662, \"ff\": 902, \"seeds\": [46.008, 49.426, 49.426], \"perturbations\": [[0, 46.008, 15], [1, 49.426, 15], [2, 49.426, 15]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 9, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s\", \"to\": \"dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -16.735, \"arrival_ns\": 27.03, \"logic_cells\": 15, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 15, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T14:58:26.933219Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 3, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-09-30 hyp-20260930-003-r3s2 (improvement, +13.90%): Pairing 64-entry tagged next-PC prediction with the retimed divider and validity-only ID/EX recovery converts CoreMark's taken-transfer bubble savings into a throughput gain by keeping redirect out of instruction decode and payload capture enables.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
