d aligned control transfer\n  updates only its indexed entry. An ordinary, illegal or uncacheable\n  instruction clears validity only for its indexed matching full tag.\n  Preserve exactly the existing train_valid/train_install semantics.\n\n  For prediction, compare each entry's reg\n…[2892 of 5964 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:65a72b6d5dcf65ef]…\ndictor payload arrays and shared training-match\n      reads with explicit scalar flop entries, local tag/counter update\n      cones, parallel index/full-tag lookup and balanced masked target\n      reduction. Preserve table policy, old-data behavior, event timing,\n      fetch queue, recovery priority, saved predictions and external IO.\n  - file: test/test_if_stage.py\n    description: |\n      Preserve existing predictor and queue checks; adapt internal state\n      inspection and extend independent model comparisons for all indices,\n      aliasing tags, counter transitions, concurrent lookup/training,\n      invalidation, replacement and reset. Keep exact prediction checks.\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: |\n      Retain all architectural programs and ISA/RVFI expectations. Verify\n      immediate once-per-advance training and unchanged saved prediction\n      recovery with entry collisions, load/M holds, queue states and both\n      bus stalls, including wrong-path stores and contiguous retirement.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
