ient sign = a[31] XOR b[31] and remainder sign = a[31]. For\\nunsigned operations, use the operands directly. Precompute zero-extended\\nD, 2D and 3D in 34 bits, with no truncation of 3D. Unroll 16 radix-4 digits\\nfrom the dividend's most significant pair to its least significant pair.\\nStarting with R=0, each digit for\n…[327820 of 330892 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:d87084334a9ae643]…\naining while retaining saved-queue checks.\\n\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\": \"Keep the existing predictor/queue and architectural retirement\\nmodels, extending coverage across bank boundaries and same-row\\ndifferent-bank events under bus, load-use and M-operation holds.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 173.4, \"delta_pct\": -9.28, \"vs_baseline\": 1330.69, \"fmax_mhz\": 70.398, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4059766, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 6421, \"ff\": 1793, \"seeds\": [67.29, 70.398, 70.398], \"perturbations\": [[0, 67.29, 14], [1, 70.398, 15], [2, 70.398, 15]], \"lutram\": 216, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.rs2_val_0_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.valid_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -9.861, \"arrival_ns\": 20.155, \"logic_cells\": 39, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 14, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T21:53:40.409644Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 11}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
