{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_49","type":"agent_message","text":"The separate counters pass correctness checks but also fall short of the fitness threshold. The timing reports point to target-alignment checks driving predictor payload write enables. I’m testing a narrower change: write payloads for legal control transfers using the decoded control type, and let alignment checks gate entry validity. Misaligned targets remain unusable."}}
