onditional/unconditional bit, a two-bit saturating direction counter,\\nand valid. Read asynchronously in parallel with instruction fetch, without\\nadding a pipeline stage. On a valid tag hit, predict the cached target for\\nan unconditional transfer or a conditional branch whose counter MSB is 1;\\notherwise predict PC+4. This predicts JAL/JALR as well as conditional\\nbr\n…[324389 of 327461 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:dc25b0123efd7bfb]…\nforward progress when populated PCs\\nlater hold ordinary, illegal, misaligned and blocking M instructions.\\nExercise hazards and independent bus stalls; retain exact RVFI retirement,\\norder and wrong-path-store checks without weakening any hard invariant.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 203.11, \"delta_pct\": 1.11, \"vs_baseline\": 1575.83, \"fmax_mhz\": 82.457, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4059766, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 4788, \"ff\": 1921, \"seeds\": [81.882, 82.457, 82.457], \"perturbations\": [[0, 81.882, 16], [1, 82.457, 17], [2, 82.457, 17]], \"lutram\": 24, \"bsram\": 7, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu/u_divider/quotient_q_30_s1\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu/u_divider/response_magnitude_q_23_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -7.213, \"arrival_ns\": 17.507, \"logic_cells\": 65, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu/u_divider\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 16, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-30T23:43:51.197968Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 13}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
